  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d341edc533226ca91352a-6fa4257f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add lentils and tomato & herb seasoning and cook, stirring, until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d341edc533226ca91352a-fc82b228.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To pan, add diced tomatoes with onion & garlic, the brown sugar and water (for the red sauce), stirring occasionally, until thickened, 4-6 minutes.\n• Stir through baby spinach leaves until wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d341edc533226ca91352a-2f7466a7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While lentils are cooking, in a small saucepan, heat the butter over medium heat.\n• Add the plain flour and cook, stirring, until a thick paste forms, 1-2 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium-low, then slowly whisk in the milk and water (for the white sauce) until smooth. Simmer, stirring constantly, until slightly thickened, 1-2 minutes.\n• Remove from heat and stir in Parmesan cheese. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d341edc533226ca91352a-9861ead8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spoon roughly 1/4 of the lentil filling into a baking dish, then top with a fresh lasagne sheet. Repeat with remaining filling and lasagne sheets.\n• Finish with a final lasagne sheet, then pour over the white sauce.\n• Bake until golden, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d341edc533226ca91352a-d61b2d7d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide herby tomato and lentil bolognese lasagne between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-670d341edc533226ca91352a-a1df6597.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
